job_title: Senior Python Backend Developer - FastAPI
company_repo: fastapi/fastapi
salary_range: "$140,000 - $180,000"
overview: "Join the FastAPI team to help develop and maintain one of the most popular Python web frameworks with over 91k GitHub stars. FastAPI is a modern, fast web framework for building APIs with Python based on standard type hints."
overview_reason: "Based on repo metadata showing 91,953 stars and description as a high-performance framework focused on developer experience and productivity."
